# Operator-only names. These settings are not application runtime configuration.
# `loadLocalEnv()` ignores them. Guarded bootstrap/verification/UAT CLIs opt in
# through `loadLocalOperatorEnv()` and enforce their own non-production gates.
# Keep values out of source control; use disposable fixtures and approved local
# secret handling. Never pass this file to the web server or a production service.

